  "title": "Children's Future BMI prediction",
  "description": {
    "p1": "This applet computes children's future height, weight, and BMI. Based on a child's current age and physical measurements, this app uses a machine learning model to compute the children's future height, weight, and BMI for a specified number of years into the future.",
